.TH MYFILEFUNCTIONS 3 "September 2026" "v0.4.1" "MyUtils Library Manual"
.SH NAME
myfilefunctions \- File processing utility functions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int wordCount(FILE *" file ", int *" lines ", int *" words ", int *" chars ");"
.br
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B myfilefunctions
module processes files to compute line/word counts and locate target search strings.
.TP
.BR wordCount ()
Calculates lines, words, and character counts inside an open file stream.
.TP
.BR mygrep ()
Searches for \fIsearch_str\fP inside \fIfp\fP and returns matching strings in \fImatches\fP.
